## Wells Fargo Auto

My professional Wells Fargo experience was not inside the production Auto Pricing organization. It was regulated Auto analytics, remediation, customer treatment, furnishing governance, validation, controls, and executive decision support.

My strongest evidence includes:

- principal analytical architect for Consumer Auto programs exceeding $1B in exposure and customer impact;
- seven years of CPI analytical-system ownership;
- leadership of 15+ major analytical workstreams and advisory/peer-review support for 10+ additional matters;
- design and governance of Direct and Indirect Auto CPI recalculation tools;
- proof-of-insurance intake and QA;
- coverage adjustments;
- customer redress;
- time-value-of-money loss-of-use relief;
