# Mock-interview protocol

Run at least four rounds.

## Round 1 — Core behavioral

- Ask one question at a time.
- Do not show the ideal answer before I answer.
- Score my response from 1–10 on:
  - Situation clarity;
  - individual Behavior;
  - analytical depth;
  - Auto/pricing relevance;
  - executive communication;
